        "d.seats",
        "public_board?.seats"
      ],
      "reason": "群侧座位数/座位列表的 v1/v2 适配器（原始 state 与视图投影两种形状都接），不是 v1 耦合；S6 删除 v1 后可简化为单一形状",
      "until": "S6"
    },
    {
      "id": "gateway-raw-seats-index",
      "file": "apps/agent-gateway/src/index.ts",
      "patterns": [
        "data?.seats",
        "d.seats"
      ],
      "reason": "原始 state 座位读取已改为 v1/v2 适配器（seatPid/seatIsBot）；S6 删除 v1 后可收紧",
